OL,4,BMowbray support no surprise - Johnson  
OL,5,GThe overwhelming support from the      
OL,6,Gworld of football for Blackburn Rovers 
OL,7,Gboss Tony Mowbray has come as no       
OL,8,Gsurprise to interim head coach Damien  
OL,9,GJohnson.                               
OL,11,FMowbray announced on Wednesday he was  
OL,12,Fstepping back from his role at the     
OL,13,FChampionship club because of health    
OL,14,Fissues with Johnson and Mike Dodds     
OL,15,Ftaking charge "for the time being".    
OL,17,FThe news sparked an outpouring of      
OL,18,Fmessages of support from EFL clubs and 
OL,19,Ffurther afield.                        
